WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850 align:start position:0%
 
while traveling alone I accidentally  became a part of a drug deal and this is  that story this all starts my senior  year of college  my boyfriend had just broken up with me  it was right before Thanksgiving that's  a whole other story in itself and I was  a hashtag heartbroken college girl I  headed home for the holidays for some  serious mom time you know paid dinners  homemade meals I'm gonna just hype you  up post-breakup  hi mom thank you so I'm sitting at home  crying my eyes out and my mom comes up  to me and she's like what if you just  went and saw Sabrina you need something  to take your mind off of this by the way  sabrina is my best friend from childhood  who was studying abroad in London at the  time at first I thought my mom was  joking with my achy-breaky heart but she  was serious I was about to graduate and  she said that this would be my gift for  making it through college and I was  stoked so that night we booked my  tickets I was to leave on Christmas Day  and spend three weeks in London in  Austria  fast-forward to Christmas Day I hop on a  plane and I make sure to document every  move on snapchat so my ex sees that I'm  absolutely crushing life and living the  best life without him I finally land in  London I see my bestie and everything  feels like it's gonna be okay  because best friends can do that we  spend a week exploring London together  and in a very similar move to my mom's  Freda goes what if we just went to  Barcelona for the weekend I forget that  in UK and Europe you can just go all  over the place so easily so we buy cheap  airline tickets like 45 euros each way  probably these sketchiest plane ever  anyway we land in Barcelona we check  into our adorable Airbnb and we get to  touristing now this is where the story  really begins it's around definition we  decide to start getting ready for dinner  donning our club outfits because after  dinner we are going to go to the hippest  Club in Barcelona since dinners in  Europe start when I'm basically getting  ready for bed we don't even get to the  dinner place until like 9:00 now at this  point it's dark outside but it's warm  enough to where we can sit outside on  the patio we order food open a bottle of  wine and I'm just sitting in freakin  Barcelona soaking it all in instead of  being on the couch like a little  cry-baby  as we are eating this man approaches me  I'm thinking to myself wow this  is getting very close to me out of  literally nowhere he whips out a brown  paper bag drops it at my feet and leaves  like sir what are you doing why did you  leave this bag does he think I am I  going to die a million thoughts start  flooding my brain because I'm truly the  most anxious more of a person I know  I've already planned my funeral it's  fine that's not a joke my funeral is  actually planned so here I am staring  down at a bag filled with who knows what  I spend about two minutes hysterically  freaking out when all of a sudden the  man returns and he looks visibly  panicked like yeah hey Sam he grabs the  bag and then runs off into the distance  I honestly blacked out so who knows  where he was going but I imagine it  being very Colton esque he just jumped  dancing in reality I think he probably  just slipped into a back alley and  disappeared my friends and I look at  each other even more confused than  before and that's when the police show  up like really I just wanted to come to  Barcelona see my best friend while maybe  simultaneously rubbing it in my ex's  face yet Here I am the police start  yelling at me where did that man go we  saw you give him something where is the  bag they kept shouting about the bag and  I don't know why they cared so much  about the bail that bag 1,000% had drugs  in it chill very chill at this point my  voice is shaking and I respond I don't  know I'm not from here but he dropped  the bag off came back to get it and then  he ran that way just as fast as they  showed up the police ran away in the  direction that the guy just went once  again I look back at my friend can  someone help me process this what is  happening are we going to the club are  we going to jail are we going to die we  finally begin to compose ourselves when  I'll give you a second to guess what  happens next the drug man returned again  without the bag he starts  at me what did you tell the police they  are looking for me I saw you talking to  them me a totally chill not anxious 21  year old starts screaming back I don't  know who you are I didn't tell them  anything so I absolutely did I  definitely sold that man out I'm so  scared because now I know that the  police are after him it felt confirmed  that he was the bad guy and I was caught  in the middle he's screaming at us for  maybe a minute threatening us everyone  is freaking out then the guy just books  it and runs away again that's it I was  sure of it this dude is probably part of  some drug cartel he's going to return to  his boss and tell him all about this I  mean he said he was watching me they're  gonna put a hit out on me I'm gonna be  dancing at the club and die all because  this guy is clearly bad at his job lost  his drugs with me and now everyone is  gonna die all my friends are clearly  just as upset so we collectively decide  it's just time to go to the club well  drink and loosen up and everything will  be fine we're walking and every face  that passes just feels like they're  staring at me you know what I'm not fine  I'm terrified we get on a train and I  tell my friend you know what actually  there's no way I can go to a crowded  Club it's too scary of a setting with  everything that just happened at this  point I'm in tears and I begged my  friends to take me back to the Airbnb we  get back and I spend the rest of the  evening paranoid that I'm just a sitting  duck waiting to be ended for knowing too  much  eventually I finally get myself off to  sleep the next morning the Sun comes up  I'm alive and my paranoia has somewhat  wait I'm quickly reminded of why I'm  there to spite my ex okay and to see my  best friend's obviously so that night I  put on my cutest outfit  go to that club I danced with not a care  of who's watching drink so much wine and  have the time of my life I'm out all  night and at 6:00 a.m. I drunkenly  stumbled to the airport and get on a  plane back to London and then the rest  of my vacate  no assassins no high-speed chases  no giant bags filled with drugs just a  lot of fun and eventually as you can see  I finally made it back to the United  States safe and sound now in case you're  wondering about what happened to the ex  well we got back together shortly after  the trip and we've been together for  four years  [Music]

